{
  "slug": "hdcd-telegram",
  "name": "Hdcd Telegram",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Rust-based Telegram channel for Claude Code. Drop-in replacement for the official Bun-based Telegram plugin — same features, 20x lighter. 3.5 MB binary, ~5 MB RAM, <50ms startup.\nIncludes access control (pairing, allowlists, group policies), voice transcription via Whisper, and all 4 MCP tools (reply, react, edit_message, download_attachment).\nAuto-downloads the correct binary for your platform on first use. Zero migration — reads existing token and access.json from the official plugin.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `access` (Manage Telegram channel access — approve pairings, edit allowlists, set DM/group policy), `configure` (Set up the Telegram channel — save the bot token and verify configuration)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `telegram`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hdcd-telegram@claude-community` from `gohyperdev/hdcd-telegram-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
